  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 401.02 Applicability",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-08-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 401.02 Applicability.\n\n(a) Subject to (b), below, the requirements in this chapter shall apply to any person who:\n\n(1) Plans to construct or reconstruct a structure that qualifies as a dam pursuant to Env-Wr 301.02; or\n\n(2) Has taken emergency measures as specified in Env-Wr 303.08 or Env-Wr 303.09.\n\n(b) The requirements in this chapter shall not apply to a dam regulated by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) pursuant to the Federal Power Act, 16 U.S.C. Chapter 12, Subchapter I.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
